"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4688070","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4156300-1843481262694475","game_id":"steam-4156300","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v0.3.0","summary":"Version 0.3.0 of the Fragment Collapse Demo changes the following:Slots no longer need to be \"activated\" by making a match of a certain sizeThis was THE thing that new players found the most confusing, so removing this makes it a lot more simple to understandOverhauled File upgradesReplaced \"enhancements\" and \"materials\" with \"data\", \"tags\", and \"utils\"Having 3 different File upgrade types means there are more ways to combine them!The default number of moves is 10 now, down from 20Tweaked how in","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-11T08:47:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262694475","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4156300-1839676055896425","game_id":"steam-4156300","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v0.2.1","summary":"Version 0.2.1 of the Fragment Collapse Demo changes the following:Fixed issues with OBS not recording when in Borderless Fullscreen/Fullscreen modes(There is still sometimes an issue when first booting the game/changing window modes, but clicking out of the game then refocussing the window seems to fix this, I'll continue trying to improve this if I can though!)Quality of life improvements:The Deck View screen now shows the current state of the grid and which bosses you've defeated this run, giv","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-04T03:38:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055896425","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4156300-1839041357023134","game_id":"steam-4156300","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v0.2.0","summary":"Version 0.2.0 of the Fragment Collapse Demo shakes things up a bit! Here's the main things I've changed for this version:The tutorial has had a massive overhaul to hopefully help new players understand what's going on!Base scoring has been tweaked:The previous version added score and combo for each activated slot. Slot upgrades would increase the amount of score/combo added for a given slotThe new version adds score and combo based on the length of the initial matchWhen a slot is activated it no","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-22T05:55:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357023134","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4156300-1837955055355751","game_id":"steam-4156300","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v0.1.3","summary":"A number of players reported issues with not having enough money to complete the tutorial. This issue has now been fixed.Thank you to everyone who reported the issue, I hope you enjoy the demo!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-10T04:19:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055355751","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:57:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4156300":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:43:38Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:43:38Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4156300":"2026-10-26T11:43:38Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4156300":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:43:38Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:43:38Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fullt